file docs-geode/edu/yonder the drafting room, one level under the index that already named it
file docs-geode/edu/yonder/tower/tally_stack.rye the symlink repointed from two levels to four
file .gitignore the root un-ignore retired; docs-geode already carries the room
file template-manifest.bron the allow and scrub rows retired; docs-geode already ships
file construction/ITINERARY.md the limb finding booked for pheromone, named rather than taken
scope the root edu room moved to a leaf, every reference repointed, every guard over it green
status GREEN -- readme_reach broken_in_living=0, seed_link at its ceiling, tracked links ok, five edu guards green
recommend check in (Keaton) -- eight laps and the edu move are landed; the publish is the one door left and its word is yours.
